{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"المضارع (présent): acheter (اِشْتَرَى)، donner (أَعْطَى)، rester (مَكَثَ)، perdre (خَسِرَ، فَقَدَ)، demander (سَأَلَ)، rendre (جَعَلَ)، mettre (شَغَّلَ)، laisser (سَمَحَ)، entendre (سَمِعَ، سَمِع)، lire (قَرَأَ)."},{"btype":"example","text":"acheter","note":"je achète، tu achètes، il/elle achète، nous achetons، vous achetez، ils/elles achètent"},{"btype":"example","text":"donner","note":"je donne، tu donnes، il/elle donne، nous donnons، vous donnez، ils/elles donnent"},{"btype":"example","text":"rester","note":"je reste، tu restes، il/elle reste، nous restons، vous restez، ils/elles restent"},{"btype":"example","text":"perdre","note":"je perds، tu perds، il/elle perd، nous perdons، vous perdez، ils/elles perdent"}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.conjugate","count":10,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.conjugate","count":10,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.conjugate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"fr","lang_name":"الفرنسية","verbs":[{"infinitive":"acheter","meaning":"اِشْتَرَى","tense":"المضارع (présent)","forms":{"je":"achète","tu":"achètes","il/elle":"achète","nous":"achetons","vous":"achetez","ils/elles":"achètent"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"donner","meaning":"أَعْطَى","tense":"المضارع (présent)","forms":{"je":"donne","tu":"donnes","il/elle":"donne","nous":"donnons","vous":"donnez","ils/elles":"donnent"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"rester","meaning":"مَكَثَ","tense":"المضارع (présent)","forms":{"je":"reste","tu":"restes","il/elle":"reste","nous":"restons","vous":"restez","ils/elles":"restent"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"perdre","meaning":"خَسِرَ، فَقَدَ","tense":"المضارع (présent)","forms":{"je":"perds","tu":"perds","il/elle":"perd","nous":"perdons","vous":"perdez","ils/elles":"perdent"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"demander","meaning":"سَأَلَ","tense":"المضارع (présent)","f